      "user_id": 205,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769031892266666
    },
    {
      "text": "Hi Mike, I need to make a return. I bought a pair of road cycling shoes a bit ago and they're just not working out for me.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 84852,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769031898199999
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, I can certainly look into that for you. Do you have your order number?",
