      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 205,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769031906533332
    },
    {
      "text": "Yep, it's VF-8675309.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 84852,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769031911799998
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you. Let me pull that up... Okay, I see the order for the road cycling shoes, delivered on December 13th. Let's see...",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 205,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769031913399998
    },
    {
